<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 71,973 bags in latest week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 71,973 bags in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 71,973 bags in the week ending Nov 10 versus 79,011 bags in corresponding week to Nov 12 last year, said Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,023,115 bags against 1,346,846 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
